    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surface is a first person linear exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you simply walk your way to the end. The point is to immerse yourself in this world presented to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There are no mechanics besides movement and looking around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being mysterious by design the story isn't told explicitly, everything is up to interpretation, all you know is that you want to reach the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras/19112980408122d352ba931af7767f73.avif?t=1740517530\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game does not contain monsters, the ambience and environments will invoke feelings of unease and even dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras/2b1b89c30575ce2edd7d63949070082c.avif?t=1740517530\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound, model and script was crafted by me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras/2e387d2e127925baa0859ed7db5060d5.avif?t=1740517530\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You have lived since birth in remote region of the megastructure, its not clear anymore how vast are its borders, you just want to see the surface once.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surface is a first person linear exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you simply walk your way to the end. The point is to immerse yourself in this world presented to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There are no mechanics besides movement and looking around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being mysterious by design the story isn't told explicitly, everything is up to interpretation, all you know is that you want to reach the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras/19112980408122d352ba931af7767f73.avif?t=1740517530\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game does not contain monsters, the ambience and environments will invoke feelings of unease and even dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras/2b1b89c30575ce2edd7d63949070082c.avif?t=1740517530\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound, model and script was crafted by me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448840/extras/2e387d2e127925baa0859ed7db5060d5.avif?t=1740517530\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You have lived since birth in remote region of the megastructure, its not clear anymore how vast are its borders, you just want to see the surface once.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "A Linear first person exploration adventure. The game is about exploring detailed and creepy liminal environments without monsters or puzzles, you simply walk and look around.",
